          "name": "In Optional Params",
          "type": "FLoadAssetAsyncOptionalParams",
          "default": "FLoadAssetAsyncOptionalParams()"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Int",
      "docs": "Attempts to asynchronously load the object referenced by this soft pointer.\nThis is a wrapper around the LoadAsync function in SoftObjectPath, and the delegate is responsible for validating it loaded the correct type\n@param\tInCompletionDelegate\tDelegate to be invoked when the async load finishes, this will execute on the game thread as soon as the load succeeds or fails\n@param\tInOptionalParams\t\tOptional parameters for async loading the asset\n@return Unique ID associated with this load request (the same object or package can be associated with multiple IDs).",
      "supportedTargets": [
        "TSoftObjectPtr*",
        "FSoftObjectPtr*"
      ]
    },
